<h1>Spelling Lists</h1>
<p>Learn these words this week.</p>
<list type="pl"><li>because</li><li>friend</li><li>their</li><li>beautiful</li></list>
<p>Spelling activity: write the word that matches each clue.</p>
<list type="ol"><li>A person who likes you: <code>friend</code></li><li>Pretty: <code>beautiful</code></li></list>
<p>Remember: <em>i</em> before <em>e</em>, except after <em>c</em>.</p>
